{"id":"ouvrier","lemma":"ouvrier","pos":"noun","rank":2993,"glosses":["worker, labourer (manual worker); workman","operator"],"ipa":"/u.vʁi.je/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/92/Fr-ouvrier.ogg/Fr-ouvrier.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"ouvriers","feminine":"ouvrière"},"formAudio":{"ouvrière":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ab/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-J%C3%A9r%C3%A9my-G%C3%BCnther-Heinz_J%C3%A4hnick-ouvri%C3%A8re.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Des ouvriers réparent la route.","en":"Workers are repairing the road.","words":[{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"to repair, fix, mend","l":"réparer"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"road"}]},{"text":"Une seule machine peut remplacer dix ouvriers.","en":"A single machine can replace ten workers.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"alone","l":"seul"},{"g":"machine, device"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to replace"},{"g":"ten"},null]},{"text":"Les ouvriers ont perdu leur emploi.","en":"Workers lost their jobs.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"lost"},{"g":"them"},{"g":"job"}]},{"text":"Un mauvais ouvrier blâme ses outils.","en":"A bad workman blames his tools.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"bad"},null,{"g":"criticism, censure"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"tool","l":"outil"}]},{"text":"Il embaucha quelques nouveaux ouvriers.","en":"He hired some new workers.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to hire, to employ","l":"embaucher"},{"g":"some","l":"quelque"},{"g":"new, novel","l":"nouveau"},null]}]}